            "question": "(a) Develop a comprehensive Failure Modes and Effects Analysis (FMEA) and diagnostic troubleshooting guide for critical subsystems of Engineering Physics.\n\n— OR —\n\n(b) Explain the complete testing and quality verification framework for Engineering Physics, covering type tests, routine tests, and environmental stress screening.",
