            "question": "(a) Formulate the complete component design methodology for a standard Programming in C++ subsystem, detailing all design equations, assumptions, and safety margins.\n\n— OR —\n\n(b) Perform a detailed dynamic response and stability analysis for Programming in C++, deriving the characteristic equations and transient response curves.",
