            "question": "(a) Explain in detail the fundamental theoretical principles, governing equations, and operational taxonomy of Object Oriented Analysis and Design with neat schematic diagrams.\n\n— OR —\n\n(b) Derive the comprehensive mathematical model for a representative Object Oriented Analysis and Design system, and evaluate its response under standard boundary test conditions.",
