            "marks": 13,
            "question": "(a) Draw and explain the complete architectural block diagram of Cyber Security and Forensics, detailing the functional responsibilities of each subsystem and their interface protocols.\n\n— OR —\n\n(b) Design a closed-loop control and monitoring framework for Cyber Security and Forensics, detailing sensor selection, signal conditioning, and feedback control algorithms.",
