            "question": "(a) Develop a comprehensive Failure Modes and Effects Analysis (FMEA) and diagnostic troubleshooting guide for critical subsystems of Cyber Security and Forensics.\n\n— OR —\n\n(b) Explain the complete testing and quality verification framework for Cyber Security and Forensics, covering type tests, routine tests, and environmental stress screening.",
