            "qNo": 12,
            "unit": 2,
            "marks": 13,
            "question": "(a) Formulate the complete component design methodology for a standard Professional Ethics in Engineering subsystem, detailing all design equations, assumptions, and safety margins.\n\n— OR —\n\n(b) Perform a detailed dynamic response and stability analysis for Professional Ethics in Engineering, deriving the characteristic equations and transient response curves.",
