            "question": "(a) Explain in detail the fundamental theoretical principles, governing equations, and operational taxonomy of Object Oriented Programming in Java with neat schematic diagrams.\n\n— OR —\n\n(b) Derive the comprehensive mathematical model for a representative Object Oriented Programming in Java system, and evaluate its response under standard boundary test conditions.",
