            "qNo": 8,
            "unit": 4,
            "question": "What is a Minimum Spanning Tree (MST)?",
            "answer": "An MST of a connected, undirected, weighted graph is a spanning subgraph that connects all vertices with minimum possible total edge weight without forming cycles.",
